OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and a scattering
OL,6,Fof showers. Some of the showers will
OL,7,Fbe heavy by the afternoon, with the
OL,8,Frisk of hail and thunder. Not
OL,9,Feverywhere will see these and will
OL,10,Fstay dry. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers may ease for a time
OL,14,Fduring the evening, allowing plenty of
OL,15,Fbright spells ahead of dusk. Showers
OL,16,Fperhaps returning overnight, though
OL,17,Fmostly light in nature. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
