OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMostly dry, with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunny spells. A few passing showers
OL,7,Fare possible, mainly in the north and
OL,8,Fwest. Turning increasingly windy and
OL,9,Ffeeling a little cooler.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fmostly dry outlook, with sunny spells
OL,13,Fand a few passing showers, perhaps
OL,14,Fmainly on Friday. Temperatures near
OL,15,Faverage so feeling cooler than of
OL,16,Flate, especially during any breezier
OL,17,Fmoments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
